# Clorinde Furina Yelan Xingqiu. ~25s Rot. Thundering Fury Clorinde Mono Hydro. Fanfare peaks at 34 DMG% in the third rotation. Clorinde does not burst to avoid wasting coordinated attacks. 2E Yelan.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
clorinde char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
clorinde add weapon="finale" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
